Ndiyo, naweza kuishi hapa mwenyewe.

39
00:02:02,415 --> 00:02:05,188
Dirisha ni kubwa!

40
00:02:05,211 --> 00:02:09,064
Kutoka hapo unaweza kuona mlima.

41
00:02:09,088 --> 00:02:11,654
Kweli ndivyo!

42
00:02:11,677 --> 00:02:14,644
Unaweza kuona Mlima Fuji pia.

43
00:02:14,668 --> 00:02:16,944
Inauma!

44
00:02:16,967 --> 00:02:19,734
Je, unaweza kuona bahari pia?

45
00:02:19,757 --> 00:02:23,690
Hapana, bahari haionekani.

46
00:02:23,713 --> 00:02:26,246
Aa, ndivyo.

47
00:02:26,269 --> 00:02:30,236
Je, usiku unaweza kuona nyota?

48
00:02:30,259 --> 00:02:34,059
Ndiyo, unaweza kuona nyota nyingi.

49
00:02:34,082 --> 00:02:36,482
Chumba kizuri sana!

50
00:02:36,505 --> 00:02:40,872
Lakini, ni kidogo cha kelele.

51
00:02:40,895 --> 00:02:43,061
Kwa nini?

52
00:02:43,084 --> 00:02:46,618
Ninaweza kusikia sauti ya gari.

53
00:02:46,641 --> 00:02:49,774
Ndiyo, nasikia vizuri.

54
00:02:49,797 --> 00:02:53,269
Je, unaweza kusikia sauti ya treni pia?

55
00:02:53,293 --> 00:02:56,660
Hapana, sikisikii.

56
00:02:56,683 --> 00:02:59,483
Hiyo ni nzuri.

57
00:02:59,506 --> 00:03:03,594
Je, naweza kununua vitu karibu hapa?

58
00:03:03,617 --> 00:03:07,350
Ndiyo, kuna supamaketi.

59
00:03:07,373 --> 00:03:09,827
Je, naweza kwenda kwa miguu?

60
00:03:09,851 --> 00:03:13,684
Ndiyo, unaweza kufika ndani ya dakika tano.

61
00:03:13,707 --> 00:03:15,787
Hii ni rahisi sana!

62
00:03:15,810 --> 00:03:18,853
Pia naweza kupika chakula.

63
00:03:18,877 --> 00:03:21,643
Jikoni pia ni pana sana.

64
00:03:21,666 --> 00:03:25,466
Ndiyo, ni rahisi sana kutumia.

65
00:03:25,489 --> 00:03:32,594
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kuondolewa bila tahadhari.

66
00:03:32,594 --> 00:03:34,094
Sehemu ya 3: Siku za Kazi na Mapumziko / Juma la Kazi na Wikiendi ya Kupumzika

67
00:03:34,094 --> 00:03:37,428
Wiki hii imekuwa nzito sana.

68
00:03:37,451 --> 00:03:41,251
Ndiyo, imekuwa nzito mno.

69
00:03:41,275 --> 00:03:44,367
Je, unafanya kazi za ziada kila siku?

70
00:03:44,390 --> 00:03:47,676
Ndiyo, kila siku ninafanya.

71
00:03:47,700 --> 00:03:49,758
Hii ni ngumu sana.

72
00:03:49,782 --> 00:03:53,982
Ninakula chakula wakati wa kufanya kazi.

73
00:03:54,005 --> 00:03:56,844
Hii si nzuri kabisa.

74
00:03:56,868 --> 00:03:58,961
Nafahamu.

75
00:03:58,984 --> 00:04:02,069
Je, unasikiliza muziki wakati wa kufanya kazi?

76
00:04:02,093 --> 00:04:04,534
Hapana, sisikilizi.

77
00:04:04,557 --> 00:04:07,324
Je, utapumzika wikiendi?

78
00:04:07,347 --> 00:04:10,114
Ndiyo, nina mpango wa kupumzika.

79
00:04:10,136 --> 00:04:12,203
Utafanya nini?

80
00:04:12,226 --> 00:04:16,026
Nitapenda kutazama filamu wakati wa kunywa pombe.

81
00:04:16,049 --> 00:04:17,690
Hii ni nzuri!

82
00:04:17,713 --> 00:04:20,886
Ninataka kwenda mgahawa ule.

83
00:04:20,910 --> 00:04:23,510
Je, mgahawa mbele ya kituo cha treni?

84
00:04:23,533 --> 00:04:27,333
Ndiyo, kila wakati kuna mstari wa watu.

85
00:04:27,356 --> 00:04:29,807
Ni maarufu sana!

86
00:04:29,830 --> 00:04:34,263
Ndiyo, ni rahisi na ladha yake ni nzuri.

87
00:04:34,286 --> 00:04:36,491
Ninapenda kwenda pia.

88
00:04:36,514 --> 00:04:39,247
Je, tutaenda pamoja?

89
00:04:39,270 --> 00:04:42,937
Ningependa kwenda, lakini sina muda.

90
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:44,793
Kwa nini?

91
00:04:44,816 --> 00:04:48,894
Nitafanya usafi na pia nitafua nguo.

92
00:04:48,918 --> 00:04:51,407
Una shughuli nyingi!

93
00:04:51,431 --> 00:04:55,049
Ndiyo, kuna mambo mengi ya kufanya.

94
00:04:55,072 --> 00:04:57,524
Tutakwenda kesho kutwa.

95
00:04:57,548 --> 00:04:59,800
Ndiyo, hakika.

96
00:04:59,823 --> 00:05:02,043
Nangojea kwa hamu.

97
00:05:02,066 --> 00:05:03,566
Sehemu ya 4: Kutunza Vitu Uliyosahau / Kutunza Vitu Uliyosahau

98
00:05:03,566 --> 00:05:06,766
Oo, tatizo!

99
00:05:06,789 --> 00:05:09,231
Umefanya nini?

100
00:05:09,254 --> 00:05:12,687
Nimesahau mfuko wangu.

101
00:05:12,710 --> 00:05:15,593
Umesahau wapi?

102
00:05:15,617 --> 00:05:19,819
Nimesahau ndani ya treni.

103
00:05:19,843 --> 00:05:22,776
Hii ni ngumu sana, eeh.

104
00:05:22,799 --> 00:05:25,466
Tutafanyeje?

105
00:05:25,489 --> 00:05:28,622
Tumwulize mhudumu wa stesheni.

106
00:05:28,645 --> 00:05:31,411
Ndiyo, tutafanya hivyo.

107
00:05:31,434 --> 00:05:33,812
Mfuko wa aina gani?

108
00:05:33,836 --> 00:05:36,735
Mfuko mweusi.

109
00:05:36,758 --> 00:05:40,392
Kuna nini ndani yake?

110
00:05:40,415 --> 00:05:44,381
Kuna pochi.

111
00:05:44,404 --> 00:05:46,890
Kuna funguo pia?

112
00:05:46,914 --> 00:05:49,914
Ndiyo, zipo.

113
00:05:49,937 --> 00:05:53,170
Ulikuwa umemwacha kwenye kiti?

114
00:05:53,193 --> 00:05:57,246
Hapana, nilimwacha kwenye rafu ya juu.

115
00:05:57,269 --> 00:06:00,962
Umemwacha kwenye rafu ya juu basi?

116
00:06:00,985 --> 00:06:04,919
Ndiyo, nikashuka na kumbeba.

117
00:06:04,942 --> 00:06:08,175
Utaonekana mara moja.

118
00:06:08,198 --> 00:06:10,467
Ninahangaika sana.

119
00:06:10,491 --> 00:06:14,180
Sasa hivi, mhudumu wa stesheni anapiga simu kwa ajili yetu.

120
00:06:14,203 --> 00:06:16,886
Umepatikana?

121
00:06:16,909 --> 00:06:20,182
Kuna habari kuwa mfuko umepatikana.

122
00:06:20,206 --> 00:06:22,382
Vizuri sana.

123
00:06:22,406 --> 00:06:25,047
Nimefuraahi sana.

124
00:06:25,070 --> 00:06:28,108
Sasa nitaenda kukiondoa.

125
00:06:28,131 --> 00:06:32,377
Eeh, tiketi pia umeipoteza?

126
00:06:32,400 --> 00:06:36,251
Aa, tiketi pia haipo.

127
00:06:36,275 --> 00:06:40,242
Tafuta vizuri kwenye mfuko wako.

128
00:06:40,265 --> 00:06:41,765
Mandhari 5: Maandalizi ya Chakula cha Sherehe

129
00:06:41,765 --> 00:06:44,810
Chakula cha sherehe kitatokea hivi punde.

130
00:06:44,833 --> 00:06:48,033
Ndiyo, maandalizi yamekwisha?

131
00:06:48,056 --> 00:06:51,323
Vinywaji vimebaridiwa tayari.

132
00:06:51,345 --> 00:06:54,012
Pombe pia umeinunua?

133
00:06:54,035 --> 00:06:57,612
Ndiyo, nimeshaiweka kwenye jokofu.

134
00:06:57,636 --> 00:07:00,203
Chakula tutakifanyaje?

135
00:07:00,225 --> 00:07:03,425
Chakula tayari nimeshapika.

136
00:07:03,448 --> 00:07:06,482
Umeshafanya usafi wa chumba?

137
00:07:06,505 --> 00:07:09,671
Ndiyo, nimeshafanya usafi.

138
00:07:09,694 --> 00:07:12,071
Mapambo yamewekwa?

139
00:07:12,095 --> 00:07:15,362
Ndiyo, maua yamepakwa kwenye ukuta.

140
00:07:15,385 --> 00:07:17,955
Viti vimepangwa?

141
00:07:17,979 --> 00:07:20,612
Hapana, bado.

142
00:07:20,635 --> 00:07:23,902
Basi, nitavitakapanga mimi.

143
00:07:23,925 --> 00:07:25,591
Tafadhali.

144
00:07:25,614 --> 00:07:28,248
Meza tutafanyaje?

145
00:07:28,271 --> 00:07:30,481
Futa ili iwe safi.

146
00:07:30,504 --> 00:07:32,238
Nimekuelewa.

147
00:07:32,261 --> 00:07:35,461
Mimi nitatoa sahani.

148
00:07:35,484 --> 00:07:38,417
Vitunguu pia tutavitakapangia?

149
00:07:38,440 --> 00:07:41,245
Ndiyo, vitakapangie.

150
00:07:41,269 --> 00:07:44,072
Nitawasha muziki pia.

151
00:07:44,095 --> 00:07:46,828
Nipigie wimbo wa kimya.

152
00:07:46,851 --> 00:07:49,518
Sawa, nitatafuta.

153
00:07:49,542 --> 00:07:52,542
Tufungue dirisha?

154
00:07:52,565 --> 00:07:55,332
Hapana, uwache ufungiwe.

155
00:07:55,355 --> 00:07:57,488
Kwa nini?

156
00:07:57,511 --> 00:08:00,118
Leo kuna baridi sana.

157
00:08:00,142 --> 00:08:01,475
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

158
00:08:01,498 --> 00:08:04,587
Hivi ndivyo maandalizi yamekwisha.

159
00:08:04,611 --> 00:08:06,111
Sehemu ya 6: Mipango ya Safari / Travel Plans

160
00:08:06,111 --> 00:08:09,199
Kutoka kesho tutakuwa likizo, sivyo?

161
00:08:09,223 --> 00:08:13,790
Ndiyo, nafikiri niende mahali fulani.

162
00:08:13,813 --> 00:08:16,613
Unaenda wapi?

163
00:08:16,636 --> 00:08:19,769
Ninaenda Kyoto.

164
00:08:19,792 --> 00:08:22,004
Hii ni nzuri!

165
00:08:22,028 --> 00:08:25,468
Nitakwenda kuingia katika maji ya moto (onsen).

166
00:08:25,491 --> 00:08:28,503
Unaenda na nani?

167
00:08:28,526 --> 00:08:31,611
Nitakwenda na familia yangu.

168
00:08:31,635 --> 00:08:35,035
Umehifadhi hoteli tayari?

169
00:08:35,058 --> 00:08:38,492
Ndiyo, nilihifadhi wiki iliyopita.

170
00:08:38,515 --> 00:08:41,925
Unaenda kwa gari?

171
00:08:41,948 --> 00:08:46,593
Hapana, nitaenda kwa treni ya Shinkansen.

172
00:08:46,616 --> 00:08:49,074
Umeshakununua tiketi?

173
00:08:49,097 --> 00:08:53,031
Hapana, sijakununua bado.

174
00:08:53,054 --> 00:08:56,487
Ni bora ukanunue mapema.

175
00:08:56,510 --> 00:08:59,845
Nitakanunua kesho.

176
00:08:59,869 --> 00:09:03,069
Kama nitaanza sasa, nitafika kwa wakati?

177
00:09:03,092 --> 00:09:06,533
Nadhani nitafika salama.

178
00:09:06,556 --> 00:09:09,996
Mimi nitakwenda baharini.

179
00:09:10,019 --> 00:09:14,076
Bahari? Unakusudia kuogelea?

180
00:09:14,100 --> 00:09:18,466
Hapana, sitakwenda kuogelea.

181
00:09:18,489 --> 00:09:21,856
Basi, utakuwa unafanya nini?

182
00:09:21,879 --> 00:09:25,679
Nitapiga picha za bahari.

183
00:09:25,702 --> 00:09:28,237
Unaenda na nani?

184
00:09:28,260 --> 00:09:31,627
Nitakwenda peke yangu.

185
00:09:31,650 --> 00:09:35,130
Kuwa makini na ufurahie.

186
00:09:35,153 --> 00:09:36,822
Asante.

187
00:09:36,845 --> 00:09:40,245
Nitakuletea zawadi kutoka Kyoto.

188
00:09:40,268 --> 00:09:43,834
Waa, nitafurahi sana kusubiri.

189
00:09:43,857 --> 00:09:47,391
Ndiyo, subiri kwa furaha.

190
00:09:47,414 --> 00:09:48,914
Sehemu ya 7: Dalili za Ugonjwa na Jinsi ya Kutibu / Symptoms of Illness and How to Respond

191
00:09:48,914 --> 00:09:51,847
Uonekana huna rangi nzuri.

192
00:09:51,870 --> 00:09:55,003
Kichwa changu kinauma kidogo.

193
00:09:55,026 --> 00:09:58,260
Labda una homa.

194
00:09:58,284 --> 00:10:00,684
Labda ni kweli.

195
00:10:00,707 --> 00:10:04,508
Ni bora urudi mapema leo.

196
00:10:04,531 --> 00:10:07,898
Lakini bado nina kazi.

197
00:10:07,921 --> 00:10:10,988
Usijitahidi mno.

198
00:10:11,011 --> 00:10:14,978
Kesho pia kuna mkutano muhimu...

199
00:10:15,001 --> 00:10:18,569
Ni bora uruhusu kabla ya kuzidi.

200
00:10:18,592 --> 00:10:22,259
Je, ni vizuri kwanza nikanywe dawa?

201
00:10:22,282 --> 00:10:25,551
Ndiyo, ni bora ukanywe.

202
00:10:25,575 --> 00:10:29,115
Je, ni vizuri nikae hospitalini pia?

203
00:10:29,138 --> 00:10:32,138
Ndiyo, ni bora uende.

204
00:10:32,161 --> 00:10:35,494
Basi, nitakwenda hospitalini mchana huu.

205
00:10:35,517 --> 00:10:37,695
Hicho ndicho kinachofaa.

206
00:10:37,719 --> 00:10:41,286
Labda nje kuna theluji kunyesha.

207
00:10:41,309 --> 00:10:44,075
Jioni itakuwa baridi zaidi.

208
00:10:44,098 --> 00:10:47,665
Ndiyo, inasikia baridi sana.

209
00:10:47,688 --> 00:10:50,722
Ni vizuri uende ukijikinga na baridi.

210
00:10:50,745 --> 00:10:53,879
Unapaswa kuvaa koti nzito.

211
00:10:53,902 --> 00:10:56,592
Ndiyo, hiyo ni bora.

212
00:10:56,615 --> 00:10:59,983
Je, ni vizuri kwenda hospitalini kwa teksi?

213
00:11:00,006 --> 00:11:03,058
Gari la moshi kinaweza kuwa bora zaidi.

214
00:11:03,081 --> 00:11:05,415
Kwa nini?

215
00:11:05,438 --> 00:11:08,921
Kwa sababu barabara zinaweza kukazika kwa theluji.

216
00:11:08,944 --> 00:11:10,420
Nimekuelewa.

217
00:11:10,443 --> 00:11:13,057
Haya, pole na uwe na siku njema.

218
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:14,813
Asante.

219
00:11:14,837 --> 00:11:18,514
Usiku huu, ni vizuri kulala polepole.

220
00:11:18,537 --> 00:11:20,937
Ndiyo, tutafanya hivyo.

221
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:22,460
Mandhari 8: Jinsi ya Kusoma Alama za Kijapani

222
00:11:22,460 --> 00:11:25,533
Tazama alama ile.

223
00:11:25,557 --> 00:11:28,652
Kuna nini kimeandikwa?

224
00:11:28,676 --> 00:11:31,849
Kimeandikwa 'Simama'.

225
00:11:31,872 --> 00:11:34,039
Inamaanisha nini?

226
00:11:34,062 --> 00:11:38,628
Inamaanisha unapaswa kusimama hapa.

227
00:11:38,651 --> 00:11:40,298
Nimekuelewa.

228
00:11:40,322 --> 00:11:43,995
Kule pia kuna kitu kimeandikwa.

229
00:11:44,019 --> 00:11:47,419
Kimeandikwa 'Usingie'.

230
00:11:47,442 --> 00:11:51,777
Inamaanisha usiingie ndani.

231
00:11:51,800 --> 00:11:53,838
Inaonekana kali sana.

232
00:11:53,862 --> 00:11:58,195
Ndiyo, ndani ya kiwanda ni hatari.

233
00:11:58,218 --> 00:12:02,430
Walisema navae helmeti.

234
00:12:02,454 --> 00:12:04,854
Nani alisema?

235
00:12:04,877 --> 00:12:07,692
Mtu wa kiwanda alisema.

236
00:12:07,715 --> 00:12:11,401
Inamaanisha nilinde kichwa changu?

237
00:12:11,425 --> 00:12:14,258
Ndiyo, nadhani ndivyo.

238
00:12:14,281 --> 00:12:17,756
Alama nyekundu ile ni nini?

239
00:12:17,779 --> 00:12:21,383
Kimeandikwa 'Usiguse'.

240
00:12:21,407 --> 00:12:25,941
Inamaanisha usiguse mashine, sivyo?

241
00:12:25,963 --> 00:12:28,597
Ndiyo, ndivyo.

242
00:12:28,620 --> 00:12:32,310
Hii inasema 'Haramu kuvuta sigara'.

243
00:12:32,333 --> 00:12:36,766
Inamaanisha usivute sigara hapa.

244
00:12:36,789 --> 00:12:39,598
Hapana kuvuta hapa, sivyo?

245
00:12:39,622 --> 00:12:43,468
Ndiyo, tutavute nje katika eneo la kuvuta.

246
00:12:43,491 --> 00:12:48,291
Kwa upande mwingine, meneja alisema nijie.

247
00:12:48,314 --> 00:12:52,363
Inamaanisha nijie ofisini, sivyo?

248
00:12:52,386 --> 00:12:55,964
Alisema pia nisiharakishe.

249
00:12:55,988 --> 00:12:59,468
Inamaanisha nirudi upesi, sivyo?

250
00:12:59,491 --> 00:13:02,225
Ndiyo, harakisha.

251
00:13:02,248 --> 00:13:04,414
Nimekuelewa.

252
00:13:04,437 --> 00:13:05,937
Mandhari 9: Kusaidia Kupika Keki

253
00:13:05,937 --> 00:13:09,373
Sasa tutaanza kupika keki.

254
00:13:09,397 --> 00:13:11,164
Hii ni nzuri!

255
00:13:11,187 --> 00:13:15,063
Tutafuata maelekezo ya kitabu cha mapishi.

256
00:13:15,086 --> 00:13:17,501
Si vigumu?

257
00:13:17,525 --> 00:13:22,491
Kama utafuata maelekezo ya mwalimu wa video, utakuwa sawa.

258
00:13:22,514 --> 00:13:25,685
Je, naweza kukusaidia?

259
00:13:25,709 --> 00:13:29,842
Ndiyo, safisha mikono yako kwanza kisha nisaidie.

260
00:13:29,865 --> 00:13:32,080
Nimeshafanya hivyo.

261
00:13:32,103 --> 00:13:36,958
Sasa, baada ya kuweka mayai kwenye bakuli, changanya.

262
00:13:36,982 --> 00:13:39,115
Hivi ni sawa?

263
00:13:39,138 --> 00:13:44,938
Ndiyo, baada ya kuweka sukari, changanya tena.

264
00:13:44,961 --> 00:13:47,228
Je, ungependeza maziwa?

265
00:13:47,251 --> 00:13:51,451
Hapana, nitapika pasipo na maziwa.

266
00:13:51,475 --> 00:13:54,213
Je, unatia maji?

267
00:13:54,236 --> 00:13:58,134
Ndio, nitatia maji kidogo.

268
00:13:58,157 --> 00:14:00,853
Baadae tutafanya nini?

269
00:14:00,876 --> 00:14:04,410
Baada ya kuchoma kwa oven, tutaipoa.

270
00:14:04,433 --> 00:14:07,366
Unachoma kwa dakika ngapi?

271
00:14:07,389 --> 00:14:10,522
Nitachoma kama ilivyoelekezwa.

272
00:14:10,545 --> 00:14:13,722
Imeandikwa dakika thelathini.

273
00:14:13,746 --> 00:14:17,146
Basi, tutachoma kwa dakika thelathini.

274
00:14:17,168 --> 00:14:19,508
Je, unapaka cream?

275
00:14:19,531 --> 00:14:23,582
Hapana, tutakula pasipo kupaka cream.

276
00:14:23,606 --> 00:14:26,139
Inaonekana kuwa tamu sana.

277
00:14:26,162 --> 00:14:29,796
Baada ya kupoza kwenye friji, tutakula.

278
00:14:29,819 --> 00:14:32,312
Ninangojea kwa hamu.

279
00:14:32,336 --> 00:14:36,022
Baada ya kusafisha, nitatia chai.

280
00:14:36,045 --> 00:14:38,292
Asante.

281
00:14:38,316 --> 00:14:42,049
Je, unakunywa chai pasipo na sukari?

282
00:14:42,072 --> 00:14:45,272
Ndio, ninakunywa pasipo na sukari.

283
00:14:45,295 --> 00:14:46,795
Mlo 10: Jinsi ya Kununua Zawadi

284
00:14:46,795 --> 00:14:50,028
Ninataka kununua zawadi.

285
00:14:50,051 --> 00:14:54,131
Kama unataka zawadi, duka lile ni zuri.

286
00:14:54,155 --> 00:14:56,522
Je, ni mbali kutoka hapa?

287
00:14:56,545 --> 00:15:00,712
Hapana, ni dakika tano kwa miguu.

288
00:15:00,735 --> 00:15:03,368
Ni nini kitamu?

289
00:15:03,391 --> 00:15:07,641
Kama ni keki, biskuti ni tamu sana.

290
00:15:07,665 --> 00:15:10,432
Je, bei ni rahisi?

291
00:15:10,455 --> 00:15:14,055
Kama bei ni rahisi, utanunua vingi?

292
00:15:14,077 --> 00:15:18,211
Ndio, kama bei ni rahisi, ninataka kununua.

293
00:15:18,234 --> 00:15:20,967
Nadhani bei ni rahisi.

294
00:15:20,990 --> 00:15:25,071
Ukitembelea duka, utafahamu.

295
00:15:25,095 --> 00:15:29,138
Ndio, kama utaenda mapema, bado litakuwa limefunguliwa.

296
00:15:29,161 --> 00:15:32,628
Kama mvua itanyesha, hatutaenda.

297
00:15:32,651 --> 00:15:35,784
Sasa hainyeshi.

298
00:15:35,807 --> 00:15:38,424
Kama kuna jua, tutaenda.

299
00:15:38,447 --> 00:15:41,182
Basi, twendeni.

300
00:15:41,206 --> 00:15:44,775
Je, duka lile linakubali kadi?

301
00:15:44,799 --> 00:15:48,599
Ndio, kama ni kadi, hakuna matatizo.

302
00:15:48,623 --> 00:15:52,640
Kama sina fedha taslimu, nitalipa kwa kadi.

303
00:15:52,663 --> 00:15:54,802
Hiyo ni bora.

304
00:15:54,826 --> 00:15:59,492
Kama hujui njia, nionyeshe.

305
00:15:59,515 --> 00:16:03,049
Kama utaangalia ramani kwenye simu, utafahamu.

306
00:16:03,072 --> 00:16:05,682
Simu ni rahisi sana.

307
00:16:05,706 --> 00:16:08,839
Kama utaichunguza, utaipata haraka.

308
00:16:08,862 --> 00:16:12,873
Kama nitaacha muda, ningependa kwenda kafeni pia.

309
00:16:12,897 --> 00:16:16,630
Kama ni kahawa, ile ni tamu sana.

310
00:16:16,653 --> 00:16:19,720
Kama utaenda mapema, utaweza kuketi.

311
00:16:19,743 --> 00:16:23,176
Ndio, twende haraka kidogo.

312
00:16:23,199 --> 00:16:25,894
Kama utakimbia, utafika kwa wakati.

313
00:16:25,917 --> 00:16:29,051
Jihadhari usianguke.

314
00:16:29,074 --> 00:16:30,574
Mlo 11: Kuunda Tabia za Afya

315
00:16:30,574 --> 00:16:34,540
Je, unaenda gymu hivi siku hizi?

316
00:16:34,563 --> 00:16:38,297
Ndiyo, naenda ili nipunguze uzito.

317
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:41,453
Unaendesha kila siku?

318
00:16:41,476 --> 00:16:45,543
Ndiyo, sasa naweza kukimbia kwa muda mrefu.

319
00:16:45,566 --> 00:16:47,734
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

320
00:16:47,757 --> 00:16:51,195
Kwanza sikufanya mazoezi kabisa.

321
00:16:51,219 --> 00:16:54,997
Unafanya mazoezi kila siku?

322
00:16:55,020 --> 00:16:59,154
Ndiyo, najaribu kutembea kadiri iwezekanavyo.

323
00:16:59,177 --> 00:17:01,423
Chakula chako unasemaje?

324
00:17:01,446 --> 00:17:05,079
Najaribu kula mboga nyingi.

325
00:17:05,102 --> 00:17:07,869
Hukuli vitamu?

326
00:17:07,892 --> 00:17:10,892
Najaribu kuziepusha.

327
00:17:10,915 --> 00:17:14,248
Mimi siku hizi nimeongeza uzito.

328
00:17:14,271 --> 00:17:17,005
Ni kwa sababu hufanyi mazoezi.

329
00:17:17,028 --> 00:17:20,314
Nguo zangu za zamani hazimwiani tena.

330
00:17:20,338 --> 00:17:23,804
Jaribu kufanya mazoezi kidogo.

331
00:17:23,827 --> 00:17:26,708
Lakini sina muda.

332
00:17:26,731 --> 00:17:30,065
Unaweza kujifanya uamke mapema.

333
00:17:30,088 --> 00:17:33,945
Umeanza kuamka mapema asubuhi?

334
00:17:33,968 --> 00:17:37,934
Ndiyo, naamka saa kumi na mbili asubuhi.

335
00:17:37,957 --> 00:17:41,176
Basi, nitajitahidi pia.

336
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:44,478
Umejifunza kuogelea gymu?

337
00:17:44,501 --> 00:17:48,114
Hapana, bado sielewi.

338
00:17:48,138 --> 00:17:51,622
Usikate tamaa, jaribu kuzoea.

339
00:17:51,645 --> 00:17:55,379
Ndiyo, nitakwenda bweni mara kwa mara.

340
00:17:55,402 --> 00:17:58,884
Jihadhari usije ukapata mafua.

341
00:17:58,907 --> 00:18:01,974
Ndiyo, nitahadhari.

342
00:18:01,997 --> 00:18:05,855
Mimi ninakunywa maji mengi.

343
00:18:05,878 --> 00:18:08,478
Hiyo pia ni nzuri kwa afya.

344
00:18:08,501 --> 00:18:11,668
Kwa hiyo nimekuwa na afya nzuri.

345
00:18:11,691 --> 00:18:13,191
Sehemu ya 12: Siku Mbaya Sana

346
00:18:13,191 --> 00:18:17,568
Leo ni siku mbaya kabisa.

347
00:18:17,591 --> 00:18:19,839
Kuna nini kilitokea?

348
00:18:19,863 --> 00:18:24,672
Asubuhi, mguu wangu ulianyatuliwa kwenye treni yenye watu wengi.

349
00:18:24,695 --> 00:18:27,662
Hiyo inaniuma sana.

350
00:18:27,685 --> 00:18:31,565
Ndiyo, iliniuma sana.

351
00:18:31,589 --> 00:18:34,481
Kuna chochote kingine kilichotokea?

352
00:18:34,504 --> 00:18:37,537
Nilipelekwa kutoka nyuma.

353
00:18:37,560 --> 00:18:39,993
Ilikuwa vigumu, eeh.

354
00:18:40,016 --> 00:18:44,416
Kwenye kazi, mkuu wangu alinikasirisha.

355
00:18:44,439 --> 00:18:47,406
Uliufanya kosa gani?

356
00:18:47,429 --> 00:18:51,696
Ndiyo, nilipotosha hati.

357
00:18:51,719 --> 00:18:54,286
Mkuu alikuita?

358
00:18:54,309 --> 00:18:57,842
Ndiyo, alinitia chumbani.

359
00:18:57,865 --> 00:19:00,498
Alinikemea kwa ukali?

360
00:19:00,521 --> 00:19:04,555
Ndiyo, alinikemea sana.

361
00:19:04,578 --> 00:19:07,460
Hiyo inafanya mtu achoke.

362
00:19:07,483 --> 00:19:11,616
Nikiwa ninarudi, mvua ilininyeshea.

363
00:19:11,639 --> 00:19:14,606
Hukukuwa na mwavuli?

364
00:19:14,629 --> 00:19:18,162
Mwavuli wangu uliibiwa.

365
00:19:18,185 --> 00:19:21,118
Aa, uliibiwa?

366
00:19:21,141 --> 00:19:26,151
Ndiyo, mwizi alibeba mwavuli wangu kwenye stendi ya duka la huduma za mkondo.

367
00:19:26,175 --> 00:19:30,375
Pia, niliangusha simu yangu na ikavunjika.

368
00:19:30,398 --> 00:19:33,249
Uliathiriwa na mtu?

369
00:19:33,272 --> 00:19:37,406
Ndiyo, niligongwa na mtu ambaye sijui.

370
00:19:37,429 --> 00:19:41,362
Siku hii imekuwa mbaya kabisa, kweli.

371
00:19:41,385 --> 00:19:42,885
Mchezo wa 13: Furaha ya Kufanya Mazoezi

372
00:19:42,885 --> 00:19:46,218
Leo hali ya hewa ni nzuri, sivyo?

373
00:19:46,241 --> 00:19:50,641
Kufanya mazoezi nje huleta hisia njema.

374
00:19:50,664 --> 00:19:52,231
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

375
00:19:52,254 --> 00:19:56,821
Napenda sana kucheza tenisi.

376
00:19:56,844 --> 00:19:59,448
Mimi pia.

377
00:19:59,471 --> 00:20:03,804
Kufanya mazoezi mwishoni mwa wiki ni bora kwa afya.

378
00:20:03,827 --> 00:20:08,694
Bwana Tanaka, je, unapenda kuangalia michezo pia?

379
00:20:08,717 --> 00:20:10,517
Ndiyo.

380
00:20:10,540 --> 00:20:14,797
Lakini, ninapenda zaidi kufanya michezo mwenyewe.

381
00:20:14,820 --> 00:20:20,020
Sina uwezo mkubwa wa kukimbia.

382
00:20:20,043 --> 00:20:22,443
Usijali, hakuna matata.

383
00:20:22,467 --> 00:20:25,600
Muhimu ni kufurahia pamoja.

384
00:20:25,623 --> 00:20:28,707
Oo, tatizo!

385
00:20:28,730 --> 00:20:31,218
Kuna nini?

386
00:20:31,241 --> 00:20:35,376
Nimek忘れtu kuja na viatu vya tenisi.

387
00:20:35,400 --> 00:20:37,200
Eeh?

388
00:20:37,223 --> 00:20:40,461
Umek忘れtu kuyaweka?

389
00:20:40,485 --> 00:20:42,136
Ndiyo.

390
00:20:42,160 --> 00:20:45,407
Nimek忘れtu kuviweka kwenye begi.

391
00:20:45,430 --> 00:20:49,076
Kutowa na viatu ni tatizo, kweli.

392
00:20:49,099 --> 00:20:54,032
Je, unajua kuwa unaweza kukodisha viatu kwenye ukaguzi?

393
00:20:54,055 --> 00:20:55,630
Ndiyo.

394
00:20:55,654 --> 00:20:58,854
Ninajua kuwa naweza kukodisha.

395
00:20:58,877 --> 00:21:01,010
Vizuri sana.

396
00:21:01,033 --> 00:21:03,930
Nitakwenda kukodisha sasa hivi.

397
00:21:03,954 --> 00:21:08,588
Aa, unajua kuwa Bwana Suzuki atakuja leo?

398
00:21:08,611 --> 00:21:12,905
Hapana, sikujua kuwa atakuja.

399
00:21:12,928 --> 00:21:16,622
Atakuja hapa hivi karibuni.

400
00:21:16,645 --> 00:21:20,533
Bwana Suzuki ana uwezo mkubwa wa kucheza tenisi.

401
00:21:20,556 --> 00:21:21,956
Ndiyo.

402
00:21:21,979 --> 00:21:27,448
Miongoni mwetu, Bwana Suzuki ndiye mchezaji bora zaidi.

403
00:21:27,471 --> 00:21:28,914
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

404
00:21:28,938 --> 00:21:33,505
Kufanya mazoezi pamoja naye kunanipa wasiwasi kidogo.

405
00:21:33,529 --> 00:21:38,896
Je, unajua kuwa Bwana Suzuki amewanunulia raketi mpya?

406
00:21:38,919 --> 00:21:42,339
Hapana, sijui.

407
00:21:42,362 --> 00:21:47,795
Natumaini kuona anatumia leo.

408
00:21:47,818 --> 00:21:50,785
Ni furaha kubwa.

409
00:21:50,808 --> 00:21:53,866
Ninangojea kuona.

410
00:21:53,889 --> 00:21:58,668
Basi, haraka ukakodishe viatu.

411
00:21:58,692 --> 00:22:00,325
Ndiyo.

412
00:22:00,348 --> 00:22:04,681
Nitakumbuka kulipa pesa kwenye ukaguzi.

413
00:22:04,704 --> 00:22:08,602
Tutatumia uwanja ule.

414
00:22:08,626 --> 00:22:10,603
Nimekuelewa.

415
00:22:10,627 --> 00:22:12,760
Nitakwenda mara moja.

416
00:22:12,783 --> 00:22:16,462
Kukimbia kwa haraka ni hatari.

417
00:22:16,486 --> 00:22:18,219
Ndiyo.

418
00:22:18,242 --> 00:22:20,642
Nitahati.

419
00:22:20,665 --> 00:22:22,165
Mchezo wa 14: Taarifa ya Kuchelewa na Kuomba Radhi

420
00:22:22,165 --> 00:22:24,565
Samahani kwa kuchelewa.

421
00:22:24,588 --> 00:22:28,040
Tumekusubiri kwa muda mrefu.

422
00:22:28,063 --> 00:22:31,711
Nimechelewa kwa sababu basi halikuja.

423
00:22:31,734 --> 00:22:34,301
Kulikuwa na ajali?

424
00:22:34,324 --> 00:22:38,857
Barabara zilikuwa zimejaa na hatukuweza kutembea kwa urahisi.

425
00:22:38,880 --> 00:22:42,280
Nilikuwa na wasiwasi na nikupigia simu.

426
00:22:42,303 --> 00:22:47,472
Simu yangu ilikwisha na nisingekupokea.

427
00:22:47,496 --> 00:22:50,463
Hiyo imetupata shida, kweli.

428
00:22:50,486 --> 00:22:53,943
Ndiyo, nilishtuka sana.

429
00:22:53,966 --> 00:22:58,703
Kwa sababu haukuwasiliana, nilikasirika kidogo.

430
00:22:58,727 --> 00:23:01,760
Ninakuomba msamaha sana.

431
00:23:01,783 --> 00:23:05,229
Nimechoka, tuachane kidogo.

432
00:23:05,253 --> 00:23:09,147
Kahawa ile inakuwa wazi, tuingie.

433
00:23:09,170 --> 00:23:11,857
Ninataka kunywa kahawa.

434
00:23:11,881 --> 00:23:16,315
Mimi nitakulipa, chagua kile unachokipenda.

435
00:23:16,338 --> 00:23:18,271
Ni sawa hivi?

436
00:23:18,294 --> 00:23:21,542
Kwa sababu nimechelewa, nitakununulia.

437
00:23:21,565 --> 00:23:24,740
Basi, nitaipokea bila haya.

438
00:23:24,763 --> 00:23:29,297
Nje kulikuwa baridi, hivyo kitu cha moto kitakuwa vizuri.

439
00:23:29,319 --> 00:23:33,453
Ghafla mvua ilianza kunyesha, na sasa ni baridi.

440
00:23:33,477 --> 00:23:37,371
Mimi sikutokwa na mvua, ilikuwa nzuri.

441
00:23:37,395 --> 00:23:41,399
Mimi pia nilikuwa na mwavuli, kwa hivyo nilikuwa salama.

442
00:23:41,423 --> 00:23:44,223
Wakati wa filamu unaendelea?

443
00:23:44,246 --> 00:23:48,179
Umeshafika tayari, hatuwezi kuiona tena.

444
00:23:48,202 --> 00:23:50,645
Ninakuomba msamaha tena.

445
00:23:50,669 --> 00:23:54,302
Kuna kipindi kingine, basi hakuna matatizo.

446
00:23:54,325 --> 00:23:56,302
Nimefarijika.

447
00:23:56,325 --> 00:23:59,892
Tuna muda, basi tufanye polepole.

448
00:23:59,915 --> 00:24:01,648
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

449
00:24:01,671 --> 00:24:06,005
Sikukasirika tena, usijali.

450
00:24:06,028 --> 00:24:07,528
Mstari wa 15: Kupima Kali / Kujaribu Kali

451
00:24:07,528 --> 00:24:11,217
Chakula hiki ni kitamu?

452
00:24:11,240 --> 00:24:16,313
Ili kujua kama ni kitamu, basi nitaonja kwanza.

453
00:24:16,336 --> 00:24:19,376
Inaonekana kali, kweli.

454
00:24:19,400 --> 00:24:24,053
Tutamuulize mhudumu ni kali vipi.

455
00:24:24,077 --> 00:24:28,564
Mhudumu alisema ni kali kidogo.

456
00:24:28,588 --> 00:24:33,154
Sijui kama tutaweza kula.

457
00:24:33,177 --> 00:24:36,511
Basi, nitaonja kidogo.

458
00:24:36,534 --> 00:24:38,312
Ni vipi?

459
00:24:38,335 --> 00:24:41,193
Ni kali mno.

460
00:24:41,216 --> 00:24:43,787
Unataka kunywa maji?

461
00:24:43,811 --> 00:24:46,780
Ndiyo, nitaonja.

462
00:24:46,803 --> 00:24:48,677
Uko sawa?

463
00:24:48,701 --> 00:24:53,381
Ni kali, lakini nitaonja tena kidogo.

464
00:24:53,404 --> 00:24:55,873
Unapenda vitu vya kali?

465
00:24:55,896 --> 00:25:00,663
Hata mimi sijui kama napenda au la.

466
00:25:00,686 --> 00:25:03,519
Una jasho, unaona?

467
00:25:03,542 --> 00:25:07,792
Ni kali mno, hata kama ni moto sijui.

468
00:25:07,816 --> 00:25:10,624
Usijaribu mno, basi.

469
00:25:10,647 --> 00:25:15,825
Kwa upande mwingine, unajua nyama hii ni ya nini?

470
00:25:15,849 --> 00:25:20,082
Tutamuulize mhudumu kama ni nyama ya nguruwe?

471
00:25:20,105 --> 00:25:24,238
Inaonekana kama ni ya kuku kwa hisia.

472
00:25:24,261 --> 00:25:27,742
Tutazame kama kinaandikwa kwenye menyu.

473
00:25:27,766 --> 00:25:31,333
Hapa hakuna kinaandikwa.

474
00:25:31,356 --> 00:25:35,489
Ni tamu, kwa hivyo aina yoyote ya nyama ni sawa.

475
00:25:35,512 --> 00:25:38,479
Tutakate deseti pia?

476
00:25:38,502 --> 00:25:42,168
Ninahisi njaa ya vitu vya tamu.

477
00:25:42,191 --> 00:25:45,161
Nitaonja keki hii.

478
00:25:45,185 --> 00:25:47,952
Unaelewa bei gani?

479
00:25:47,975 --> 00:25:51,208
Nitazama bei kwenye menyu.

480
00:25:51,231 --> 00:25:53,898
Natumai si ghali sana.

481
00:25:53,921 --> 00:25:55,421
Sehemu ya 16: Jinsi ya Kutumia Lugha ya Heshima / Matumizi Sahihi ya Lugha ya Heshima

482
00:25:55,421 --> 00:25:58,354
Keki hizi ni nzuri sana!

483
00:25:58,377 --> 00:26:03,062
Ndiyo, zilinipatiwa na mtu wa kampuni tunayoshirikiana nayo.

484
00:26:03,086 --> 00:26:06,173
Je, ni keki za duka maarufu?

485
00:26:06,197 --> 00:26:10,397
Ndiyo, mkurugenzi alinunua kwa ajili yangu.

486
00:26:10,420 --> 00:26:13,253
Ni nzuri sana!

487
00:26:13,276 --> 00:26:17,156
Ndiyo, nilifurahi sana.

488
00:26:17,180 --> 00:26:20,746
Je, naweza kupata moja?

489
00:26:20,769 --> 00:26:23,703
Bila shaka, karibu.

490
00:26:23,726 --> 00:26:25,692
Asante.

491
00:26:25,715 --> 00:26:27,649
Nitakula.

492
00:26:27,672 --> 00:26:30,145
Ina ladha gani?

493
00:26:30,168 --> 00:26:32,968
Ni tamu sana.

494
00:26:32,991 --> 00:26:38,158
Kwa upande mwingine, je, unaweza kunipikia chai kwa ajili ya meneja?

495
00:26:38,180 --> 00:26:41,260
Ndiyo, nitakupikia chai.

496
00:26:41,284 --> 00:26:46,729
Kumwambia meneja 'nitakupikia' ni adabu mbaya.

497
00:26:46,752 --> 00:26:49,018
Aa, ndivyo ilivyo.

498
00:26:49,041 --> 00:26:50,522
Samahani.

499
00:26:50,546 --> 00:26:54,319
Tafadhali mpikie chai kwa heshima.

500
00:26:54,342 --> 00:26:56,675
Ndiyo, nimeelewa.

501
00:26:56,698 --> 00:27:01,498
Asubuhi uliwapa mbwa wako chakula?

502
00:27:01,521 --> 00:27:04,888
Ndiyo, nilimpa kabla ya kutoka.

503
00:27:04,911 --> 00:27:10,477
Je, unaweza kunywesha mimea ya ofisini pia?

504
00:27:10,500 --> 00:27:13,500
Ndiyo, nitafanya sasa hivi.

505
00:27:13,523 --> 00:27:17,857
Kwa kweli, mwandamizi alinikopesha kitabu.

506
00:27:17,880 --> 00:27:20,046
Ni kitabu cha aina gani?

507
00:27:20,069 --> 00:27:24,128
Nimeambiwa ni kitabu kizuri sana.

508
00:27:24,151 --> 00:27:28,218
Je, unaweza kunipiga picha ya kifuniko baadaye?

509
00:27:28,241 --> 00:27:31,610
Ndiyo, nitapiga na kukutumia.

510
00:27:31,634 --> 00:27:33,634
Asante.

511
00:27:33,657 --> 00:27:38,132
Je, unaweza kunisaidia kuandaa mkutano wa kesho?

512
00:27:38,156 --> 00:27:42,325
Ndiyo, nitakusaidia kwa furaha.

513
00:27:42,348 --> 00:27:44,836
Unanisaidia sana.

514
00:27:44,860 --> 00:27:46,360
Sehemu ya 17: Kuweka Akiba na Kuandaa Kuhamia Nyumbani / Kuweka Akiba na Kuandaa Kuhamia

515
00:27:46,360 --> 00:27:51,093
Unafanya kazi ya muda kila siku, sivyo?

516
00:27:51,116 --> 00:27:55,349
Ndiyo, naweka akiba ili kununua nyumba.

517
00:27:55,372 --> 00:27:59,306
Kununua nyumba kunahitaji pesa ngapi?

518
00:27:59,329 --> 00:28:02,495
Inahitaji pesa nyingi sana.

519
00:28:02,518 --> 00:28:06,885
Kufanya kazi kwa ajili ya familia ni kitu kizuri.

520
00:28:06,908 --> 00:28:11,397
Naweka akiba pia ili kwenda likizo na familia.

521
00:28:11,421 --> 00:28:14,554
Unaenda wapi kwa likizo?

522
00:28:14,577 --> 00:28:17,510
Ninaenda Hawaii.

523
00:28:17,533 --> 00:28:22,200
Kwa upande mwingine, hii mkasi hutumika kwa nini?

524
00:28:22,223 --> 00:28:27,310
Hutumika kukata boksi za kubebea wakati wa kuhamia.

525
00:28:27,333 --> 00:28:31,424
Sanduku hili kubwa lina umbo gani?

526
00:28:31,448 --> 00:28:35,497
Ni kwa ajili ya kuweka mizigo muhimu.

527
00:28:35,520 --> 00:28:39,404
Unahitaji kadhaa ili kuhamia.

528
00:28:39,427 --> 00:28:43,761
Ndiyo, ni rahisi kwa kubeba nguo.

529
00:28:43,784 --> 00:28:49,263
Kutoka nyumbani mpya hadi ofisi, unachukua muda gani?

530
00:28:49,286 --> 00:28:52,486
Ninachukua saa moja kwa treni.

531
00:28:52,509 --> 00:28:56,076
Safari ya kila siku ni ndefu sana, haijui?

532
00:28:56,099 --> 00:29:01,510
Ndiyo, lakini kwa treni naweza kusoma kitabu vizuri.

533
00:29:01,533 --> 00:29:05,867
Umeununua kitabu ili ujifunze Kijapani, sawa!

534
00:29:05,890 --> 00:29:10,890
Ndiyo, lakini kutafuta maneno kwa kamusi inachukua muda mrefu.

535
00:29:10,913 --> 00:29:15,313
Mwanzo huwa ni vigumu, unachukua muda kutafuta.

536
00:29:15,336 --> 00:29:20,069
Hivi karibuni, pia nimeanza mazoezi kwa ajili ya afya.

537
00:29:20,092 --> 00:29:24,959
Aa, umeununua viatu vipya ili kukimbia, ndiyo?

538
00:29:24,982 --> 00:29:29,715
Ndiyo, viatu hivi ni bora sana kwa mazoezi.

539
00:29:29,738 --> 00:29:34,705
Mimi huwa sikuli sana ili nipunguze uzito.

540
00:29:34,728 --> 00:29:37,261
Hii si nzuri kabisa.

541
00:29:37,284 --> 00:29:40,559
Tafadhali kula ili uishi kwa afya.

542
00:29:40,582 --> 00:29:43,982
Sawa, nitahifadhi afya yangu.

543
00:29:44,005 --> 00:29:48,461
Hata kulala, binadamu hutumia nguvu.

544
00:29:48,484 --> 00:29:53,318
Basi, nitalala vizuri ili nistarehe kesho.

545
00:29:53,341 --> 00:29:56,542
Ndiyo, pumzika polepole.

546
00:29:56,565 --> 00:29:58,809
Usiku mwema.

547
00:29:58,833 --> 00:30:00,333
Mzozo 18: Maandalizi Kabla ya Dhoruba

548
00:30:00,333 --> 00:30:04,566
Anga limeanza kung'aa giza.

549
00:30:04,589 --> 00:30:07,889
Ndiyo, mvua inaelekea kunyesha sasa hivi.

550
00:30:07,912 --> 00:30:11,124
Upepo pia umeanza kunyesha kwa nguvu.

551
00:30:11,148 --> 00:30:13,601
Inaonekana kama dhoruba inakuja.

552
00:30:13,624 --> 00:30:17,998
Ni bora tupate kuepuka na kuingia ndani ya jengo haraka.

553
00:30:18,021 --> 00:30:21,662
Basi, nitaondoa mizigo iliyo nje.

554
00:30:21,685 --> 00:30:25,255
Upepo unaweza kuvunja mwavuli.

555
00:30:25,279 --> 00:30:28,412
Upepo ni mkali sana, kweli!

556
00:30:28,435 --> 00:30:31,869
Ghafla imekuwa baridi.

557
00:30:31,893 --> 00:30:35,093
Hii inaweza kusababisha mafua.

558
00:30:35,116 --> 00:30:39,524
Nitakwenda kununua chai moto huko.

559
00:30:39,547 --> 00:30:41,218
Tafadhali.

560
00:30:41,242 --> 00:30:43,242
Nimenunua.

561
00:30:43,265 --> 00:30:46,633
Chai hii inaonekana moto sana.

562
00:30:46,656 --> 00:30:49,623
Tunahitaji kuwa makini tunapoiweka.

563
00:30:49,646 --> 00:30:53,447
Ndiyo, nitajaribu kunywa kidogo.

564
00:30:53,470 --> 00:30:56,804
Inaonekana moto na ladha nzuri.

565
00:30:56,827 --> 00:31:00,118
Ndiyo, ni tamu sana!

566
00:31:00,141 --> 00:31:03,875
Aa, anga limeanza kung'aa.

567
00:31:03,898 --> 00:31:07,031
Mvua inaelekea kusimama.

568
00:31:07,054 --> 00:31:10,465
Ndiyo, imekuwa na jua.

569
00:31:10,488 --> 00:31:13,724
Ni heri kweli!

570
00:31:13,748 --> 00:31:16,604
Huko, mvua inaelekea kuwa upinde wa mvua.

571
00:31:16,628 --> 00:31:19,707
Nitakwenda kuangalia nje kidogo.

572
00:31:19,730 --> 00:31:22,530
Unaweza kuona upinde wa mvua mzuri?

573
00:31:22,553 --> 00:31:26,687
Hapana, bado hauonekani wazi.

574
00:31:26,710 --> 00:31:31,148
Baada ya kupata raha, ninaelekea kuwa na njaa.

575
00:31:31,171 --> 00:31:35,174
Unaonekana kama unataka kulia kwa njaa.

576
00:31:35,198 --> 00:31:38,237
Nitakwenda kula karibu hapa.

577
00:31:38,260 --> 00:31:40,718
Sawa, rudi haraka.

578
00:31:40,742 --> 00:31:43,076
Nitarudi mara moja.

579
00:31:43,099 --> 00:31:44,599
Mzozo 19: Kula Kupita Kiasi na Matatizo ya Viatu

580
00:31:44,599 --> 00:31:48,599
Chakula cha mchana, nilikula kidogo kupita kiasi.

581
00:31:48,622 --> 00:31:52,588
Buffet huwa unaweza kula kupita kiasi.

582
00:31:52,611 --> 00:31:57,219
Nilikula kupita kiasi, na sasa naumwa mno tumboni.

583
00:31:57,242 --> 00:32:00,609
Umelewa juisi baridi sana?

584
00:32:00,632 --> 00:32:05,499
Ndiyo, nimelewa glasi tatu, nimelewa sana.

585
00:32:05,522 --> 00:32:09,331
Keki ya mwisho pia ilikuwa tamu mno.

586
00:32:09,355 --> 00:32:14,557
Pia, viatu nilivyovaa leo vinanitisha kutembea.

587
00:32:14,580 --> 00:32:17,713
Je, ukubwa wake ni mdogo mno?

588
00:32:17,736 --> 00:32:21,775
Hapana, kilemba chake ni refu mno.

589
00:32:21,799 --> 00:32:25,799
Usijiteme, tutumie teksi badala ya kutembea?

590
00:32:25,822 --> 00:32:30,876
Ndiyo, ninachoka kutembea, tutumie teksi.

591
00:32:30,899 --> 00:32:33,710
Tumefika dukani ya vifaa vya kazi za ofisi.

592
00:32:33,734 --> 00:32:36,934
Kalamu hii inaandikia vizuri sana.

593
00:32:36,957 --> 00:32:41,157
Ni kweli. Bei yake pia ni rahisi mno.

594
00:32:41,180 --> 00:32:44,799
Ni nyepesi na rahisi kutumia.

595
00:32:44,823 --> 00:32:48,438
Basi, mimi nitachukua kalamu hii nyekundu.

596
00:32:48,461 --> 00:32:51,296
Mimi nitanunua kitabu.

597
00:32:51,319 --> 00:32:55,653
Lakini, kitabu hiki ni ngumu kuelewa.

598
00:32:55,676 --> 00:32:59,492
Ni kweli, kuna kanji nyingi mno.

599
00:32:59,515 --> 00:33:03,091
Kwa mimi ni ngumu mno kusoma.

600
00:33:03,115 --> 00:33:06,448
Je, tutachukue kitabu rahisi zaidi?

601
00:33:06,471 --> 00:33:09,438
Ndiyo, hicho kitakuwa bora.

602
00:33:09,461 --> 00:33:14,227
Kiti hapa kwenye kafe kina giza kidogo mno.

603
00:33:14,250 --> 00:33:17,250
Ni vigumu kuona herufi za kitabu.

604
00:33:17,273 --> 00:33:20,673
Nitawasha taa ya meza.

605
00:33:20,696 --> 00:33:23,904
Aa, hiyo ni mwanga mno.

606
00:33:23,928 --> 00:33:27,339
Basi, nitaipunguza mwanga kidogo.

607
00:33:27,362 --> 00:33:29,995
Ndiyo, sasa ni sawa kabisa.

608
00:33:30,018 --> 00:33:33,985
Je, muziki wa dukani ni mkubwa mno?

609
00:33:34,008 --> 00:33:37,680
Hapana, ni kimya na rahisi kusikiliza.

610
00:33:37,704 --> 00:33:40,377
Basi, tutaachia kiti hiki.

611
00:33:40,400 --> 00:33:42,933
Ndiyo, nakubali.

612
00:33:42,956 --> 00:33:44,456
Sehemu ya 20: Kutatua Matatizo ya Kurudisha Bidhaa

613
00:33:44,456 --> 00:33:48,623
Mfuko nilionunua kwa mtandao umefika.

614
00:33:48,646 --> 00:33:51,312
Haraka tuufungue.

615
00:33:51,335 --> 00:33:55,469
Aa, sehemu imevunjika.

616
00:33:55,492 --> 00:33:59,225
Nimeilipa pesa nyingi.

617
00:33:59,248 --> 00:34:03,386
Niliitazamia sana, ni bahati mbaya.

618
00:34:03,410 --> 00:34:07,843
Ikiwa imevunjika tangu mwanzo, tutafanya nini?

619
00:34:07,866 --> 00:34:11,722
Inafaa kurudisha dukani.

620
00:34:11,746 --> 00:34:15,642
Nimewahi kupiga simu lakini hawajibu.

621
00:34:15,666 --> 00:34:20,799
Duka halifungi leo, ni ajabu.

622
00:34:20,822 --> 00:34:26,189
Kama haitafu kwa simu, nitatumia barua pepe.

623
00:34:26,212 --> 00:34:30,812
Nimetuma barua pepe lakini bado sijapata jibu.

624
00:34:30,835 --> 00:34:35,891
Kama jibu linachelewa, subiri kidogo.

625
00:34:35,915 --> 00:34:40,448
Nimesubiri kwa wiki moja ili ifike.

626
00:34:40,471 --> 00:34:44,679
Ikiwa unahitaji haraka, utaleta?

627
00:34:44,703 --> 00:34:49,138
Nilitamani sana, nitakata tamaa.

628
00:34:49,162 --> 00:34:55,562
Hata kama watatuma bidhaa mpya, ukubwa unaweza kutofautiana.

629
00:34:55,585 --> 00:35:00,427
Ikiwa itakuwa kubwa mno kuliko chumba, nitakuwa na shida.

630
00:35:00,450 --> 00:35:06,017
Nimejaribu kusoma maelekezo ili nirekebishe lakini sijaelewa.

631
00:35:06,040 --> 00:35:10,510
Kama hujaelewi, mimi nitasoma.

632
00:35:10,533 --> 00:35:15,616
Nimejifunza Kijapani lakini kanji hizi sijui kusoma.

633
00:35:15,639 --> 00:35:20,378
Kama usiweze kusoma, tumia kamusi ya simu.

634
00:35:20,402 --> 00:35:25,569
Nilikupromise tutaondoa pamoja, lakini rafiki yangu hajaja.

635
00:35:25,592 --> 00:35:31,795
Kama rafiki yangu hatakuja, tutaondoa wenyewe tu wawili?

636
00:35:31,818 --> 00:35:37,427
Mimi niko hapa na huzuni hii, lakini wewe unacheka.

637
00:35:37,451 --> 00:35:41,684
Kama unataka kulia, unaweza kulia.

638
00:35:41,707 --> 00:35:47,907
Ninataka kutoka ili nipunguze mkazo, lakini mvua inanyesha na sina mwavuli.

639
00:35:47,930 --> 00:35:53,174
Kama nitakunyeshewa, nitarudi nyumbani na kubadilisha nguo.

640
00:35:53,197 --> 00:35:57,444
Leo niko na uchovu, lakini kwa sababu ya mshtuko, sipati usingizi.

641
00:35:57,468 --> 00:36:03,468
Kama usipati usingizi, utaweza kunywa chai moto?

642
00:36:03,491 --> 00:36:06,092
Ndiyo, tutafanya hivyo.

643
00:36:06,116 --> 00:36:07,616
Sehemu ya 21: Kukutana na Simu / Simu na Uratibu wa Kukutana

644
00:36:07,616 --> 00:36:10,783
Halo, uko wapi sasa?

645
00:36:10,806 --> 00:36:15,610
Nimefika stesheni tulikokutana sasa hivi.

646
00:36:15,633 --> 00:36:20,087
Samahani, niliota nje kwa haraka sasa hivi.

647
00:36:20,111 --> 00:36:23,544
Basi, bado hujafika.

648
00:36:23,567 --> 00:36:27,534
Ndiyo, inapaswa nichukue dakika kumi hivi.

649
00:36:27,557 --> 00:36:31,490
Niko nikiungoja mbele ya stesheni.

650
00:36:31,513 --> 00:36:36,080
Samahani sana, niko nikikimbia sasa hivi.

651
00:36:36,103 --> 00:36:40,877
Nimekuwa nikikupigia simu kidogo tu kwa sababu ya kuchelewa.

652
00:36:40,900 --> 00:36:44,300
Sasa hivi nimepanda treni.

653
00:36:44,323 --> 00:36:48,656
Kama ni treni ya haraka, inapaswa ukafike kwenye kituo cha pili.

654
00:36:48,679 --> 00:36:51,479
Ndiyo, inapaswa nifike hivi karibuni.

655
00:36:51,502 --> 00:36:55,336
Kwa upande mwingine, umekula chakula cha mchana?

656
00:36:55,359 --> 00:36:59,192
Ndiyo, nilikula kabla ya kutoka.

657
00:36:59,215 --> 00:37:02,986
Basi, inapaswa usiwe na njaa.

658
00:37:03,009 --> 00:37:05,976
Ndiyo, nina shiba.

659
00:37:05,999 --> 00:37:09,565
Mimi niko nikiandaa kula sasa.

660
00:37:09,588 --> 00:37:13,841
Kwa kweli, mkutano wa asubuhi umekwisha?

661
00:37:13,865 --> 00:37:17,632
Ndiyo, umekwisha sasa hivi.

662
00:37:17,655 --> 00:37:20,422
Meneja alikasirika?

663
00:37:20,445 --> 00:37:23,941
Hapana, haipaswi kukasirika.

664
00:37:23,964 --> 00:37:28,431
Lakini, nilikasirishwa kwa simu sasa hivi.

665
00:37:28,454 --> 00:37:31,888
Ni kuhusu kuchelewa, ndiyo?

666
00:37:31,911 --> 00:37:36,445
Nitakapofika ofisini, nitakwenda kuomba msamaha.

667
00:37:36,468 --> 00:37:40,547
Kama utaomba msamaha kwa unyofu, utakuwa sawa.

668
00:37:40,570 --> 00:37:42,203
Nitapigania.

669
00:37:42,226 --> 00:37:45,797
Nimekamilisha hati ulinilombezwa sasa hivi.

670
00:37:45,821 --> 00:37:49,191
Basi, inapaswa isiwe na makosa.

671
00:37:49,215 --> 00:37:53,348
Niko nikitazama data kwa simu yangu sasa.

672
00:37:53,371 --> 00:37:55,470
Inapaswa kuwa kamili.

673
00:37:55,494 --> 00:37:58,294
Ndiyo, hakuna matatizo.

674
00:37:58,317 --> 00:38:00,521
Fanya haraka na uje.

675
00:38:00,544 --> 00:38:02,044
Sehemu ya 22: Maandalizi ya Harusi ya Bwana Tanaka / Maandalizi ya Harusi ya Tanaka

676
00:38:02,044 --> 00:38:07,286
Mwanzoni mwa mwezi ujao, Bwana Tanaka ataoa ndoa.

677
00:38:07,310 --> 00:38:09,000
Kweli?

678
00:38:09,024 --> 00:38:12,157
Anaonekana furaha sana.

679
00:38:12,180 --> 00:38:13,747
Ndiyo.

680
00:38:13,770 --> 00:38:17,770
Mwenzake anasemekana kuwa mzuri sana.

681
00:38:17,793 --> 00:38:21,959
Baada ya kuoa, atachokaa kazi?

682
00:38:21,982 --> 00:38:25,422
Hapana, anasemekana hatoki.

683
00:38:25,446 --> 00:38:27,694
Hiyo ni nzuri.

684
00:38:27,718 --> 00:38:32,991
Lakini, siku hizi anaonekana kuwa na shughuli nyingi kwa ajili ya maandalizi ya harusi.

685
00:38:33,014 --> 00:38:34,589
Ndiyo.

686
00:38:34,613 --> 00:38:38,080
Inasemekana kuwa kuandaa kila siku ni vigumu.

687
00:38:38,103 --> 00:38:42,282
Inasemekana watasherehekea mwishoni mwa wiki.

688
00:38:42,305 --> 00:38:45,116
Tunasemekana tutaitwa pia.

689
00:38:45,140 --> 00:38:49,540
Hapana, tunasemekana hatutaitwi.

690
00:38:49,563 --> 00:38:52,238
Ni kidogo machungu, sivyo?

691
00:38:52,261 --> 00:38:55,294
Inasemekana watasherehekea familia pekee.

692
00:38:55,317 --> 00:38:57,207
Nimeelewa.

693
00:38:57,231 --> 00:39:01,600
Inaonekana kuwa meneja anajua kuhusu harusi.

694
00:39:01,624 --> 00:39:03,190
Ndiyo.

695
00:39:03,213 --> 00:39:06,347
Inasemekana amewahi kutoa zawadi tayari.

696
00:39:06,369 --> 00:39:09,736
Sisi pia tuwahi kutoa kitu.

697
00:39:09,759 --> 00:39:11,726
Hii ni nzuri!

698
00:39:11,749 --> 00:39:16,824
Kwa kweli, inasemekana kuwa kesho itanyesha.

699
00:39:16,847 --> 00:39:20,913
Ndiyo, inaonekana hali ya hewa itakuwa mbaya sana.

700
00:39:20,936 --> 00:39:24,870
Inasemekana mwishoni mwa wiki itakuwa baridi zaidi.

701
00:39:24,893 --> 00:39:29,026
Inaonekana kuwa Bwana Tanaka ana mafua sasa hivi.

702
00:39:29,049 --> 00:39:33,049
Ndiyo, inasemekana amewahi kunywa dawa mapema.

703
00:39:33,072 --> 00:39:37,530
Usijitwishe, ni bora urudi nyumbani mapema na kupumzika.

704
00:39:37,553 --> 00:39:41,320
Inasemekana atakwenda hospitali baada ya mchana.

705
00:39:41,343 --> 00:39:45,635
Matokeo ya uchunguzi yanaonekana si ugonjwa mkubwa.

706
00:39:45,659 --> 00:39:49,792
Inasemekana mwenza wake amefarijika.

707
00:39:49,815 --> 00:39:52,020
Ni heri kweli!

708
00:39:52,043 --> 00:39:53,543
Sehemu ya 23: Kukabiliana na Shughuli za Gharama / Kutatua Shughuli za Dharura

709
00:39:53,543 --> 00:39:56,544
Meneja, samahani.

710
00:39:56,567 --> 00:39:58,413
Kuna nini?

711
00:39:58,437 --> 00:40:02,704
Naomba niruhusiwe kuondoka mapema leo.

712
00:40:02,727 --> 00:40:05,327
Kuna jambo lolote?

713
00:40:05,350 --> 00:40:08,916
Mtoto wangu amepata homa ghafla.

714
00:40:08,939 --> 00:40:11,824
Hii ni ngumu sana, eeh.

715
00:40:11,848 --> 00:40:16,681
Nitakuwa nikirudi nyumbani na kumpeleka hospitali.

716
00:40:16,704 --> 00:40:19,671
Rudi mapema.

717
00:40:19,694 --> 00:40:21,393
Asante.

718
00:40:21,417 --> 00:40:25,350
Kazi yako nitaiweka kwa mtu mwingine.

719
00:40:25,373 --> 00:40:30,663
Naomba Bwana Yamada anisaidie na kazi yangu?

720
00:40:30,686 --> 00:40:33,970
Ndiyo, nitamwambia.

721
00:40:33,994 --> 00:40:37,802
Naomba niruhusiwe kupumzika kazi kesho pia?

722
00:40:37,826 --> 00:40:40,099
Kesho pia?

723
00:40:40,123 --> 00:40:46,123
Mke wangu hawezi kupumzika, na ningependa nimpeleke kazini.

724
00:40:46,146 --> 00:40:48,112
Nimekuelewa.

725
00:40:48,135 --> 00:40:51,135
Kesho nitakuwezesha kupumzika.

726
00:40:51,158 --> 00:40:53,492
Samahani sana.

727
00:40:53,515 --> 00:40:58,198
La hasha, kwanza mpe mtoto wako nafasi ya kupumzika.

728
00:40:58,221 --> 00:41:02,702
Nikirudi nyumbani, nitamnywesha dawa mara moja.

729
00:41:02,725 --> 00:41:06,259
Usimfanye mtoto wako ajitwishe.

730
00:41:06,282 --> 00:41:10,215
Ndiyo, nitamlaza mapema leo.

731
00:41:10,238 --> 00:41:14,005
Nitasubiri mawasiliano yako asubuhi ya kesho.

732
00:41:14,028 --> 00:41:18,322
Nitakutumia taarifa za hali kwa simu baadaye.

733
00:41:18,345 --> 00:41:22,756
La, kwa sababu ni dharura, barua pepe inatosha.

734
00:41:22,780 --> 00:41:27,355
Naomba niruhusiwe kuchukua kazi kidogo nyumbani?

735
00:41:27,378 --> 00:41:31,219
La, leo usifanye kazi.

736
00:41:31,242 --> 00:41:34,097
Asante sana.

737
00:41:34,120 --> 00:41:37,087
Ingia salama.

738
00:41:37,110 --> 00:41:39,080
Nitakuaga.

739
00:41:39,103 --> 00:41:41,074
Mpate nafuu.

740
00:41:41,097 --> 00:41:42,597
Sehemu ya 24: Jinsi ya Kutumia Lugha ya Heshima / Jinsi ya Kutumia Heshima katika Lugha ya Kijapani

741
00:41:42,597 --> 00:41:47,031
Mkurugenzi amefika ofisini tayari?

742
00:41:47,054 --> 00:41:50,621
Ndiyo, amefika sasa hivi.

743
00:41:50,644 --> 00:41:54,377
Sasa yuko wapi?

744
00:41:54,400 --> 00:41:58,093
Yuko katika chumba cha mkutano.

745
00:41:58,117 --> 00:42:02,717
Umesoma tayari maelezo ya leo?

746
00:42:02,740 --> 00:42:06,940
Ndiyo, nimesoma tayari.

747
00:42:06,963 --> 00:42:10,129
Alisema nini?

748
00:42:10,152 --> 00:42:13,795
Alisema ni maudhui mazuri sana.

749
00:42:13,819 --> 00:42:16,464
Hiyo ni nzuri.

750
00:42:16,487 --> 00:42:21,921
Kwa kweli, je, mkurugenzi hucheza golf mara kwa mara?

751
00:42:21,944 --> 00:42:26,582
Ndiyo, hucheza golf kila mwishoni mwa wiki.

752
00:42:26,605 --> 00:42:30,239
Je, kesho utakwenda golf pia?

753
00:42:30,262 --> 00:42:34,428
Hapana, kesho atapumzika nyumbani.

754
00:42:34,451 --> 00:42:37,885
Unaonekana kidogo uchovu hivi siku zijazo.

755
00:42:37,908 --> 00:42:42,752
Ndiyo, kesho atapumzika nyumbani.

756
00:42:42,776 --> 00:42:47,469
Kwa upande mwingine, je, mkurugenzi huyu atakula keki hii?

757
00:42:47,492 --> 00:42:51,226
Ndiyo, atakula kwa furaha.

758
00:42:51,249 --> 00:42:54,782
Je, atakunywa chai pamoja?

759
00:42:54,805 --> 00:42:59,172
Hapana, daima hunywa kahawa.

760
00:42:59,195 --> 00:43:02,090
Nimeelewa. Nitakagua tayari.

761
00:43:02,113 --> 00:43:06,363
Je, meneja pia yuko chumbani mkutano sasa?

762
00:43:06,386 --> 00:43:10,474
Hapana, meneja amekwenda safarini.

763
00:43:10,497 --> 00:43:13,867
Atarudi lini hapa?

764
00:43:13,891 --> 00:43:17,326
Atarudi kesho jioni.

765
00:43:17,350 --> 00:43:22,116
Je, alimsalimia mkurugenzi kabla ya safari?

766
00:43:22,139 --> 00:43:25,776
Ndiyo, alimsalimia asubuhi hii.

767
00:43:25,800 --> 00:43:29,633
Aa, mgeni amefika.

768
00:43:29,656 --> 00:43:33,889
Basi, mpeleke kwenye chumba cha ukaribishaji.

769
00:43:33,912 --> 00:43:36,312
Vema.

770
00:43:36,335 --> 00:43:39,310
Mkurugenzi yupo ndani akingojea.

771
00:43:39,334 --> 00:43:40,834
Sehemu ya 25: Salamu na Utangulizi wa Mradi

772
00:43:40,834 --> 00:43:44,846
Hajambo, naomba kufanya kazi pamoja nanyi.

773
00:43:44,869 --> 00:43:48,069
Pia, naomba kufanya kazi pamoja.

774
00:43:48,092 --> 00:43:54,532
Leo, nitatoa maelezo kuhusu mradi mpya.

775
00:43:54,555 --> 00:43:57,189
Sawa, tafadhali.

776
00:43:57,212 --> 00:44:00,849
Nimesoma maelezo uliotumia mapema.

777
00:44:00,872 --> 00:44:02,769
Asante.

778
00:44:02,793 --> 00:44:06,459
Nimeona ni mpango mzuri sana.

779
00:44:06,482 --> 00:44:09,325
Asante kwa kunipa sifa hiyo.

780
00:44:09,349 --> 00:44:14,315
Gharama za kina zitakutumwa kwa barua pekee baadaye.

781
00:44:14,338 --> 00:44:16,305
Nitangoja.

782
00:44:16,328 --> 00:44:21,161
Mkurugenzi wetu alisema asante kwa kunisaidia.

783
00:44:21,184 --> 00:44:23,017
Asante.

784
00:44:23,040 --> 00:44:25,276
Tafadhali mpe salamu zangu.

785
00:44:25,300 --> 00:44:30,385
Mara inayofuata, nitakuletea sampuli ya bidhaa mpya.

786
00:44:30,408 --> 00:44:32,542
Asante kwa taabu hiyo.

787
00:44:32,566 --> 00:44:34,465
Usijali.

788
00:44:34,488 --> 00:44:39,421
Nimefurahi kukutana na wewe katika ofisi yenu leo.

789
00:44:39,444 --> 00:44:42,578
Mimi pia nimefurahi kukusalimia.

790
00:44:42,601 --> 00:44:46,334
Kesho nitakupigia simu tena.

791
00:44:46,357 --> 00:44:49,324
Utapigia saa ngapi?

792
00:44:49,347 --> 00:44:52,227
Nitakupigia saa tisa mchana.

793
00:44:52,250 --> 00:44:54,543
Sawa.

794
00:44:54,566 --> 00:44:57,737
Una maswali yoyote?

795
00:44:57,760 --> 00:45:00,328
Kwa sasa hakuna.

796
00:45:00,352 --> 00:45:04,249
Basi, leo tutaondoka hapa.

797
00:45:04,273 --> 00:45:06,744
Endelea na tahadhari njiani.

798
00:45:06,767 --> 00:45:10,500
Asante kwa kutuchagua katika ratiba yako ya shughuli nyingi.

799
00:45:10,523 --> 00:45:13,057
Tutakuona tena.

800
00:45:13,080 --> 00:45:14,446
Ndiyo.

801
00:45:14,469 --> 00:45:18,036
Ninangojea kwa hamu kukutana nawe tena.

802
00:45:18,059 --> 00:45:20,792
Ninangojea mawasiliano yako.

803
00:45:20,815 --> 00:45:23,415
Nitakupigia bila shaka.

804
00:45:23,438 --> 00:45:25,972
Tafadhali nitegemee.